WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.600
Camera, chat, shop, map… so many apps?

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Nodbusiness brings them all together in one app.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.600
Post your photos and moments on your Personal feed.

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Friends like, comment and chat with you.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.600
Scroll your Personal feed: friends' posts, photos and news.

6
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.000
Tap a photo to zoom in, without leaving the page.

7
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.900
Tap ⤢ to peek at a friend, right where you are.

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Switch to Business and see what your friend sells.

9
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.400
Switch to the Business feed: shops and services near you.

10
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.000
Your friends' businesses are here too.

11
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:56.400
Search hotel room near you.

12
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:04.000
Hotels appear nearest first, with price and rating.

13
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.000
Peek at each hotel without leaving the page.

14
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.400
Compare rooms, prices and reviews.

15
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.900
Pick the room you like and book.

16
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
The hotel answers you in Messages.

17
00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:23.866
Tap Build your mini website. No skills needed.

18
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Choose your kind of business.

19
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:30.000
Pick a ready-made template…

20
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:35.000
…and your website is ready in one tap.

21
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:41.000
Or start from scratch and add the parts you need with +.

22
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.900
Add a photo straight from your phone.

23
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.300
Type your business name and a few words.

24
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:54.900
Paste a link to your video or social pages.

25
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.200
Tap the days you are open.

26
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:02.500
Add products with a photo and a price.

27
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:08.400
Pick your colour.

28
00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.500
It looks great on computer, tablet and phone.

29
00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:19.500
Tap Publish: your website is live!

30
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:23.500
It appears in the Business feed for everyone to find.

31
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.500
Followers are told, and anyone can scan your QR code.

32
00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.000
Customers order and send you messages.

33
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.900
They pay you directly. Nodbusiness never holds your money.

34
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.500
You confirm, and the order is done.

35
00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.800
Your life and your business, in one account.

36
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:50.500
Nodbusiness: everything in one place. Start free.
